### Phase 7: Accessibility Compliance (WCAG 2.1 AA)

- Text contrast ratios strictly enforced for Sapphire text against glass/white backgrounds.
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` fully supported (disables springs/bounces).
- Ensure focus rings (Mint) are sufficiently thick (2px) and visible.
